<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">1 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Mɛkɛn nyɛ nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Te</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl yii Mɛkɛn nyɛ nakwyal bot ɛ ghaada</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonik ɛ</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakus zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ, é mɛndjoŋ mɛ yii ebá yii ɛkɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Bhii nyɛ nadus kɔ ghaada Filip ɛ, nyɛ naazyɛ kɔ ghaada Tesalonik.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ghaada Tesalonik ɛ́ pak pɛ ɛko ɛ kyee dik Ghɛlɛs, nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo kyee dik Masedwan. Tesalonik ɛ́ ghaada mɛbom. Mbula bɛdjoŋ nadidi ɛ́ kɔ ghaada tak, daŋ-daŋ ɛ́ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda. Tin, bɛdhiiti bot tɔ mbyak eYuda nabɛ ɛ́ ààdi ekwyɛl mɛlyo ɛ Pɔl, wɔ gwaa, bɛ ɛzɛsɔ nyɛ. Pɔl nakwyal mɛkana ɛ́, étɛp bot ɛ Tesalonik namyaal ɛbwaalel ɛ na bes ɔ. Deenek, nyɛ kadjedjɛ mɛlyo mɛ ɛ́, pɛ daa lɔɔ. Bɛlyoel gek ɛ́ náá, yɛ ɛ́ mɛkana mɛ mɛkɛn Pɔl nakwyal nɛ ekeletyɛ ɛ. Yɛ di deenek ɔɔ, yɛ ɛ́ pes mɛkana na mwa tɔ bɛmɛkana mɛ Ɛbhɛŋ ɛ na Bes.</para>
  <para style="ip">Tin, ɛlaŋel ɛ mɛkɛn e mɛkana mak (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1-3">1–3</ref></char>) kaada mena ɛ́, ɛgwakel ɛ Pɔl nadi nɛ yɛ nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ. Tɔ ɛlaŋel ená kɛkum yii etɛn (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4-5">4–5</ref></char>), Pɔl ɛpedjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bot ɛ Tesalonik, étɛp bɛ neetɔ́ sok, tɔ tsik ekeletyɛ bɛ di nɛ yɛ ɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana mak ɛ́ étɛp ɛkoobal zyaala nadi tɔ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ na bes nyɛ nakus ɛ. Zyaala tak nabɛ ɛ́ dum nɛ bɛmɛlyo, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛbula ɛ Klisto. Nyɛ ɛpebaadjɛ mɛghaaz mɛ ɛsa mɛsa nɛ ekeletyɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛtsek mɛ mɛkana mak ɛ́ dáak:</para>
  <para style="io1">Mɛswosel (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:1">1.1</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">dáa bot ɛ Tesalonik nadum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 1:2-3:13">1.2–3.13</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">tsik Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:1-12">4.1-12</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">ɛbwaalel tɔ ɛbula ɛ Klisto (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 4:13-5:11">4.13–5.11</ref></char>);</para>
  <para style="io1">mɛlyo nɛ mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1TH 5:12-28">5.12-28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Yɛ ɛ́ mam Pɔl zɛnɔɔ Silas nɛ Timote. Bis kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ́ étɛp bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛ ghaada Tesalonik, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto ɔ. Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ egwyem di nɛ nen!<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb bot ɛ Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Bis nɛ bulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛlu djas kɔ ɛsu ɛ len. É ghɛŋ bis di edjaala ɛ, bis nɛ baadjaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ biyɔ djas. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Sok bhwoob Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka bis nɛ taala mɛlu djas dáa bi di ghiŋ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ mɛsa mɛ kwyɛl, zɛnɔɔ ɛbwaalel bi di nɛ yɛ nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bis nɛ gu náá, Zɛɛb nɛ kwyɛl bin, nyɛ nasɛ́ɛ bin ɛ, étɛp bi needi bɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Deenek, é sok bis nagoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ mɛkpa nɛ mɛkpa toto. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil, nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ dɔɔ nɛ ɛbwaalel djas. É sok mena nadika sama ɛ, bi nabee mɛfulu mɛ bis nadi nɛ yɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Tin, bi naabaŋa mɛfulu mes, nɛ yii Ghɛŋ. Ye nakoozodi mezuk men, bi naabatamyaal Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb nɛ mɛmyaala mɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ di edjɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />É di'enek, bi moo ɛ́ bot ɛ di náá, bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb pɛ ghaada Masedwan nɛ bot ɛ ghaada Akayi aakadu mɛfulu mɔɔ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Tin, yɛ ɛ́ kɔ kyee dik'en ɛ mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ nakan ɛgoolaaa, deenek, ye naakɛ kɔ kyee dik Masedwan djas nɛ kyee dik Akayi. Tin, é edi djas, bot djas nɛ gu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb, bis tok nɛ ghwyil ɛbaalii kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Bot djas ɛpelii dáa bi nabe bis, é sok bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, nɛ dáa bi nakat ɛduwal ɛ́ bɛzɛɛb ɛ ekpaka-ekpaka e bɛnagisɛ, étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nyɛy mot di tɛtɛ Zɛɛb, di nɛ tsik ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Tinaak, bi ɛpebwood náá, Mɔn'ɛ, mot di edus pɛ tɔ gwoo ɔ zyɛ. Mɔn'ɛ tak ɛ́ Yezu, mot Zɛɛb nagomal pak bot ɛ zegwyɛ ɔ. Yɛ ɛ́ Mɔn'ɛ tak ɛ kwaapɛk mena é epɛ́ɛ e Zɛɛb di ezyɛ ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Mɛsa ɛ Pɔl pɛ kyee dik Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààzyɛ pɛ yebɔ kɔ toto. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Tin, bi nɛ baagu náá, é ghɛŋ sok bis naaleeaa, nɛ ɛtiigaa pɛ kɔ ghaada Filip. Tin, Zɛɛb naadjɛ bis mɛghaaz mɛ ɛgoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal tɔ boo tuub bis nadi eswak nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Etɛɛ náá, mɛlyo mɛ bis di elyo bin ɛ, ye tok esua-esua etsal. Ye tok náá, bis eewo ze. Tin, bis ààsaa ɛkɔɔ mot. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Tin, bis zolii ɛ́ dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Etɛɛ náá, nyɛ eebee náá, nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel nɛ nes, nyɛ bookyeed bis, bis kɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. É di'enek, bis ààsaa náá, bot ɛ bɔs myaala nɛ nes, bi saŋ ɛ́ náá, Zɛɛb myaala nɛ nes, nyɛy mot di egu esiiza e elyem bis ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, bis ààlii wak étɛp ɛkɔp ɛ bot, tin, ɛkwosak ɛ les nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ, étɛp bis needi tɔ dɔɔb epata kɔ elo bin, Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyaasɛs yes. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààsaa náá, bot djɛ bis duu, ye nakoozodi biyɔ nɛghu bɛdhiiti bot. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Tin, dáa ye di náá, bis ɛ́ bot ɛ lwoma ɛ Klisto ɛ, bis nabɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛnɛɛg bin si mɛtiŋ mes. É di'enek, é sok bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, bis nadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛsila nɛ nen dáa moma di ekwyɛɛg bɔn bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Deenek, bis nabɛ ɛ́, bis moo nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nen dhaa tyɛ. Kwyɛl tak naasa náá, bis nàzosik kɔ ɛdjɛ bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb. Tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis naakwyɛl ɛdjɛ bin, dɔɔ nɛ tsik'es. Ye nabɛ ɛ́, bi moo nɛ boo mɛtaŋ é mis mes. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bi ɛpetaala nɛ mezuk mes nɛ etuŋ bis. Tin, bis nadi ɛ́ tɔ mɛsa mwos nɛ pum, ekaab náá, bis ɛzɛkɛdi nɛ nen boo ɛbɛp, yɛ ɛ́ deenek ɛ́ bis di egoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Biyɔ ɛ́ di bɛtyaasɛs bis, dɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb pe ɛ́ tyaasɛs yes, bis nabɛ ɛ́ bis naakɛ tɔ epiki, tɔ edɛɛ, ààlyoaa djin é mis mɛ biyɔ bot ɛ zeedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Bi nɛ baagu náá, bis nadi nɛ nen ɛ́, dáa sɛɛg bɔn di edi nɛ bɔn bɛ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Tin, bis nabɛ ɛ́, bis naadjɛ bin mɛghaaz nɛ mɛlyo. Bis naawaab nɛ nen nɛ ghwyil djas náá, bi kɛ tɔ epiki dáa Zɛɛb di ekwyɛl ɛ. Nyɛy mot di ekwyɛl náá, bi ni tɔ Ɛyoŋ ɛ lɛ, nɛ tɔ duma yɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Bis ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb mɛlu djas etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ bis nagoola bin Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, bi naagwak yɛ. Tin, bi naamyaal yɛ dáa Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, ààbɛ dáa mɛkpa mɛ bot ɛ bɔs. Deenek, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ yɛ ɛ́ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, yɛ ɛ́ di esa mɛsa tɔ len, biyɔ bot ɛ zedum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg bam, bi eebaŋa ezɛɛga mendjaala Zɛɛb di pɛ kyee dik Yude ɛ, bot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. Bi naazuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ kyee dik'en, yɛ ɛ́ dhatyee bot ɛ ezɛɛga mendjaala menek zezuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Bɔɔ ɛ́ naagó Ghɛŋ Yezu nɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb, tin, bɛ naawa mena tɔ tsik mezuk. Deenek, Zɛɛb ààmyaala nɛ nɔɔ, bɛ moo ɛ́ bot ɛ bhyen bot ɛ bɔs djas. <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />Deenek, bɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛlu bis náá, bis nàgoola bot ɛ di ààbɛ bot ɛ mbyak eYuda ɔ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal di nɛ ghwyil ɛtsik bɛ ɛ. É di'enek, bɛ ɛ́ kuku ɛbil ɛ mesyem kɔ mesyem mɔɔ bɛ di ezezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa sok ɛ. Tin, ɛbuk ɛ Zɛɛb moo ɛ́ kɔ lɔɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ekwosak ɛ Pɔl ɛ́ náá, nyɛ baasik pɛ kyee dik Tesalonik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, yɛ kabɛ bisɔ ɔɔ, bis bɛka nɛ nen ɛ́ ba mɔɔ ɛwala batsa, mena bɛkaka ɛ́ edi, tin, menaka ɛ́ edi wat tɔ sisim. Bis ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛkwosak náá, mena baabomaka, dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ́, bis di esa mɛghaaz étɛp ɛkum pɛ yebɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Bis ɛpekwyɛl náá, bis baazyɛ pɛ yebɔ. Deenek, mam Pɔl, esok nɛ esok mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛzyɛ penek, tin, Satan nadi elu bis. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Deenek, ye tok bɛdhiiti bot, yɛ ɛ́ biyɔ ɛ́ di ɛbwaalel ɛ les nɛ mɛmyaala mes, bi ɛ́ kɔtɔ duu yes, yii bis aadiig bet é mis mɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu é sok nyɛ aabula ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Deenek, nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ biyɔ ɛ́ di edjɛ bis duma nɛ mɛmyaala!<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Deenek, bis nabɛ ɛ́ ààkabɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmaad, bis naabee náá, ye goka ɛ́ bis lik bisɔ bɛmet kɔ ghaada Atɛn. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Deenek, ye bɛ ɛ́ bis eekyeed mɔn-nyɛɛg'es Timote, mot bis nɛ bɛnɔɔ di egyee tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɔ. Nyɛy ɛ́ di egoka nɛ ɛdjɛ bin ghwyil nɛ mɛghaaz tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />Deenek, mot ngɔt tɔ len needi ààkwyit tɔ mɛtiiga mɛ bɛ di etiig bis ɛ. Bi nɛ gu biyɔ bɛmet náá, etɛp djas ee bis di ebee wak ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ Zɛɛb nyɛ ɛmet ɛ di ekwyɛl náá, bis boma nɛ yɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />É ghɛŋ bis nadi pɛ yebɔ ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́, bis naalɛɛ bin náá, bis ɛ́ waatiigaa. Yɛ ɛ́ sa bis di eboma nɛ yɛ ɛ, bi nɛ gu yɛ ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Dáa mɛ nadi ààkabɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛmaad ɛ, yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mɛ nalwom Timote, nyɛ neezɛbaŋa bis menduk mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ bwoo náá, dim mot mɛbhowal ɛzɛkɛwa bin tɔ mɛbhowal, deenek, da mɛsa mɛ bis nasa kɔ ɛsu ɛ len ɛ, gwyɛ toto.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Tin, dáa Timote nabula pɛ daa len ɛ, nyɛ naabaŋa bis tɛtɛ Bhaadal dum nɛ kwyɛl'en, dɔɔ nɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ eelɛɛ bis náá, bi nɛ taala bis ɛbuɛpe, ɛkwosak ɛ len ɛ́ náá, mena baabomaka dáa bisɔ pe baadi ekwos ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />É di'enek bɔn-nyɛɛg, tɔ etuŋ nɛ mezuk mes djas, ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb naadjɛ bis mɛghaaz. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Nenak, bis ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala nɛ tsik, etɛɛ náá, bi ɛ́ ghiŋ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Bis bulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ len dáa? Etɛɛ náá, bi ɛpedjɛ bis boo mɛmyaala é mis ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Mwos nɛ pum bis nɛ wa zii é ɛdjaala Zɛɛb étɛp mena neebaabomaka, étɛp bis neebaadjɛ bin sa bi di ààbɛ nɛ yɛ tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ Zɛɛb ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nyɛy ɛmet nɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu djɛ bis ze, étɛp bis neezyɛ pɛ yebɔ! <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Beta náá, Ghɛŋ sa náá, kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ pak'en ɛ, nɛ kwyɛl bi di ekwyɛl bot djas ɛ, gheetetɔ́ sok. Tin, kwyɛl tak goka nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ dáa kwyɛl bis di ekwyɛl bin ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Beta náá, Ghɛŋ djɛ bin mɛghaaz étɛp bi needi bot ɛ́ na dɛɛ, ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ, é mis ɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'enaka, nɛ é sok Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu aazyɛ nɛ bot bɛ djas ɛ. <char style="sc">Amɛn</char>!<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Mɛfulu mɛ Zɛɛb di emyaala nɛ yɛ ɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bis naazelyaal bin dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛkɛ, étɛp Zɛɛb neemyaala nɛ nen ɛ. Tsɛɛtsɛ, bi eezesa yɛ. Nenak, bis ɛpedjaala nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu, baasaka, dhaa-dhaŋak yii bi nadi esesa sok ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Tin, bi nɛ gu mɛlyo mɛ bis zedjɛ bin dum nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ, ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Gwakeka ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb: Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi bot ɛ́ na dɛɛ, sa bi ààdi tɔ membyam. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Deenek, mot nɛ mot gu ɛbaal ɛ nyel'ɛ tɔ edɛɛ nɛ duu djas. <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />Sa bi ààbet náá, embee mɛkwosak dhaa bin ghwyil, dáa bot ɛ di ààdi bot ɛ mbyak eYuda, bot ɛ di ààgu Zɛɛb ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Tin, tɔ etɛp bak, sa mot ààsa mɔn-nyɛɛg ɛbiyo, nɛghu ɛkɔɔ nyɛ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ bis eelɛɛ bin, bis naadul bin mɛlɔ náá, Ghɛŋ ɛ́ waawa bot ɛ di esa membi mɛ etɛp binek ɔ é feŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Tin, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjóo mena étɛp mena needika tɔ mɛzɔ. Ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp mena needika tɔ edɛɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Yɛ ɛ́ étɛp tak ɛ mot di ebyen mɛlyo mak ɔ, nyɛ ààbyen mot. Tin, nyɛ byen ɛ́ Zɛɛb mot di edjɛ bin Sisim na Dɛɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />É di'enek, bi tok nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ kwyal bin mɛkana kɔ ɛsu ɛ kwyɛl pak'en. Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naalyaal bin dáa bi di egoka nɛ ɛkwyɛla pak'en ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Kwyɛl tak ɛ́, bi di etel nɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bin djas di tɔ Masedwan ɔ. Tin, bɔn-nyɛɛg bis, bis ɛpedjɛ bin mɛghaaz étɛp bi neebaasa dhaa yii bi nadi esesa sok ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Tin, saaka náá, bi di tɔ egwyem, waka lyem tɔ etɛp bin met, saka mɛsa nɛ mɛmbɔ men met, dáa bis naloolyo bin ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />É di'enek, mɛfulu men é mis mɛ bot ɛ di ààdum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ aasa náá, bɛ djɛ bin duu. Tin, bi aanàdi ɛbɛp, étɛp dhiiti mot.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɛbula ɛ Ghɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, ɛkwosak ɛ les ɛ́ náá, bi gu etsɛɛtsɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ, etɛɛ náá, bi needi ààdi nɛ ghoŋ tɔ elyem dáa bɛdhiiti bot, bot ɛ di ààdi nɛ ɛbwaalel ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Bis nɛ ɛmyaal náá Yezu naagwyɛ, gom bhis ɛsyee. Tin, bis nabaamyaal náá, kɔ lo ɛ Yezu, Zɛɛb ɛ́ waagomal bot djas nazegwyɛ, bɔɔ edum koŋ nɛ Yezu ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Beeka sa bis di elyo bin dum nɛ mɛkpa ɛ Ghɛŋ ɛ. Ye tok náá, bot aalik nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs é ghɛŋ Ghɛŋ aazyɛ ɔ, yɛ ɛ́ bɔɔ ɛ kwaaleebyet tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, ɛsok nɛ bot ɛ nazegwyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />É di'enek, bot waagwak boo tsim ekomanda, gwood boo kukuma efofop, zɛnɔɔ bham tɔŋ ɛ Zɛɛb. Tin, Ghɛŋ nyɛ ɛmet aasul tɔ gwoo. Deenek, bot ɛ nazegwyɛ, bɔɔ edum ɛ koŋ nɛ Klisto ɔ, bɔɔ ɛ́ kwaadi bot ɛ mɛkɛn é ɛgom. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Bhii tak, bot aadi nɛ tsik kɔ bɔs dwoo lɛɛg ɔ, bɛ waabyet sama nɛ bot ɛ nazegom bhis ɛsyee ɔ, tɔ́ tɔ gwoo, tɔ eguud pɛ ɛko étɛp ɛkɛboma nɛ Ghɛŋ. É di'enek, mena aakadika ɛ́ kɔm-kɔm sama nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Djɛelka mɛghaaz pak'en nɛ mɛkpa mak.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="s">É bhwood ɛlu ɛ Ghɛŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bi tok nɛ gwyes náá, bɛ kwyal mɛkana kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛwala nɛ dwoo etɛp bak djas aasael ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, dwoo Ghɛŋ aabula ɛ, yɛ aadi ɛ́ zaka. Tin, nyɛ aazyɛ ɛ́ é pum dáa mot djii. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />É ghɛŋ bot aakeke náá: «Bis ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe, bis ɛ́ tɔ egwyem ɛ», é di'enek ɛ, mezuk aatuula kɔ lɔɔ zaka, dáa moma di egwak ɛbɛl ɛ. Tin, mot ngɔt aanàkwaadi kiid é mezuk menek. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Deenek, biyɔ bɔn-nyɛɛg, bi tok tɔ ghooghom, etɛɛ náá, dwoo tak neetuula bin zaka, dáa mot djii di etuula tɔ ndjaŋ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ biyɔ djas ɛ́ bot ɛ gwyɛ, bot ɛ mwos. Tin, mena tokeka bot ɛ pum, ààbɛ bot ɛ ghooghom. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Tin, sa mena ààdjaka egó dáa bɛdhiiti bot, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ ndjem, nɛ ɛdi ɛ́ bot ɛ di edil elyem ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Bot ɛ́ di edja gɔ́ ɔ, bɛ dyeebadja gɔ́ ɛ́ é pum. Bot di edɛ mɛnyok ɔ, bɛ dyeebadi nɛ elangi e tak ɛ́ é pum. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka bot ɛ mwos ɔɔ, mena gokaka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi bot ɛ́ ɛdil ɛ lyem. Djhoonɔɔka ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ kwyɛl dáa ghun, da ɛbwaalel ɛ tsik ɛ́ di dáa kɔtɔ dɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Deenek, Zɛɛb nabɛ ɛ́ ààdjóo mena étɛp nyɛ neepɛ́ɛ mena, tin, ye nabɛ ɛ́ étɛp mena needika nɛ tsik nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Klisto nagwyɛ ɛ́ kɔ ɛsu ɛ lena, étɛp mena needika nɛ tsik sama nɛ nɛ ye nakoozodi náá, menaka ɛ́ ndjem, nɛghu menaka ɛ́ é egɔ́. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Djɛelka mɛghaaz nɛ ɛlyoel pak'en tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb dáa bi di boozezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo mɛ mɛsik nɛ mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bis waab nɛ nen náá, bi duwal bot ɛ di esa mɛsa pak'en ɔ, bot ɛ Ghɛŋ nalwom bɛ náá, bɛ djɛɛd bin nɛ ɛdul ɛ bin mɛlɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Tin, lyaalka bɛ náá, bi nɛ looba nɛ nɔɔ, bi ɛ́ nɛ kwyɛl nɛ nɔɔ dhaa tyɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛsa mɛ bɛ di esa ɛ. Dika tɔ egwyem pak'en.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, bis ɛpedjɛ bin mɛghaaz náá: Dulka bɛtsak-bel ɛ bot mɛlɔ, djɛka bot ɛ di nɛ bwoo ɔ mɛghaaz, kwyeeka elɛtɛ e bot, dika nɛ ɛmaad ɛ lyem nɛ bot djas. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Bi ɛ́ kobaka, sa mot ààbulal ɛbiyo nɛ ɛbiyo. Tin, gheesaaka ɛsa enɛm esa pak'en dɔɔ nɛ bot djas.<verse eid="1TH 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Dika mɛlu djas tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Djaalaka ngwyis, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />bulalka bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb é etɛp djas, yenek ɛ́ ɛkwosak ɛ Zɛɛb dum nɛ biyɔ, bot ɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Sa bi ààlu Sisim na Dɛɛ náá, nyɛ sa mɛsa mɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />Sa bi ààdyamal mɛkpa mɛ bɛngoolel ɛ Mɛkpa ɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Tin, sɔska etɛp djas, da bi ɛ́ baal sa di nyɔ ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Tsetaka nɛ membi mɛ esa djas di ebiyo ɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Beta náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet mot di ɛsuk ɛ egwyem ɔ, sa náá, bi di tɔ edɛɛ nyel djas. Deenek, nyɛ baal esisim bin, elyem bin, dɔɔ nɛ mɛnyel men djas, étɛp bi needi ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ, dwoo Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto aabula ɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Zɛɛb mot nadjóo bin ɔ, nyɛ waasa náá etɛp binek djas sael, etɛɛ náá, nyɛ ɛ́ sosoob.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Bɔn-nyɛɛg, djaalaka pe étɛp'es.<verse eid="1TH 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Swoselka pak'en nɛ mɛbeedela, dáa bɔn-nyɛɛg tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1TH 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Deenek, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen nɛ din ɛ Ghɛŋ náá, bi laa mɛkana mak é mis mɛ bɔn-nyɛɛg bin djas tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb.<verse eid="1TH 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Betka náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ Ghɛŋ'enaka Yezu Klisto di nɛ nen.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>